Form validation rules (match backend):
- timeout_seconds: 0.5 to 30.0
- expected_status: 100 to 599
- port: 1 to 65535
- DNS record_type: only A or AAAA (dropdown)
- urls (egress): textarea, one URL per line, max 50
- hostname/host: max 253 characters

UI behavior:
- Show latency_ms in milliseconds where available
- Show ok as green checkmark, failure as red X with detail message
- Egress results show per-URL table with pass/fail counts summary
- DNS results show list of resolved addresses
- Health page auto-refreshes every 30 seconds
- Loading states during API calls
- Error boundary catches unexpected failures

Tests to include:
- Renders each page without crashing
- Form validation prevents submission with invalid input
- Successful API response renders result correctly
- Failed API response (ok: false) shows error detail
- Mock all API calls — no real network requests in tests

Follow react-app-generator agent conventions exactly.
Functional components and hooks only — no class components.
PascalCase for components, camelCase for functions and variables.